// A wall item panels the back and scrapes it off. The rock in front never changes.
// Shift is sprint, never a wall modifier: left mouse panels, right mouse (scrape) takes lining back.
map
########################
#......................#
#......................#
#......................#
#......................#
#..@...................#
########################
end
give TimberWall 20
give Stone 4
place 2 4 -2 TimberWall
expect 3 wall:4,-2,timber == 1
expect 3 is:4,-2,Empty == 1
expect 3 ev:Place >= 1
scrape 4 4 -2
expect 5 wall:4,-2,none == 1
expect 5 is:4,-2,Empty == 1
// the granite floor: panelling it does not replace the granite
place 7 4 1 TimberWall
expect 8 is:4,1,Granite == 1
expect 8 wall:4,1,timber == 1
